                                <Info className="flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5 text-blue-600"/>
                                <div><strong>CORS Requirement:</strong> Your custom endpoint must be configured to handle CORS (Cross-Origin Resource Sharing) requests from this domain. Ensure your server returns the `Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *` header or specifies this app's origin.</div>
                            </div>
